<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>* Macro for Chixia - Auto Attack *

*--------------------------------------------------------------*
|This macro will help you attack when you switch to Jinxi.     |
| NOTEs:                                                       |
|  1. You can set the operaing mode whatever you want.         |
|  2. If macro gets bugged,change delays by youself.           |
|     Because it depends on your FPS and LATENCY.              |
|     You can also use some tools to unlock your fps limit.    |
|     Macro will work better when you have 200+ fps.           |
|  3. You should have the character before using the macro.    |
*--------------------------------------------------------------*</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
